esolving the major visual and performance bugs you have been reporting over the past few days.\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f: Bug Fixes & Performance Upgrades*\n\n\n*OpenXR Screen Tearing:* Completely resolved the OpenXR glitch causing severe screen tearing during gameplay.\n*Black Box Glitch:* Fixed the recurring issue where a solid \"black box\" would obstruct your display.\n*Rendering Artifacts:* Eliminated the vertical stripes and related rendering bugs.\n*Frame Budget Optimization:* Stabilized the overall frame rate for a significantly smoother VR experience.", "created_date": 1788437971, "id": "28128855153440449", "version": "6.6.8", "version_code": 310, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28128849836774314"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6795516673867606", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28178388931820404"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1035305641058942"}]}, "change_log": "Version 6.6.8 (Build 309)\n\nIn this update, we are bringing exciting new ways to win and improving your overall Pokeroo experience:\n\n\nNew Daily Bonus Slot Machine: Claim your free chips every day with our brand-new interactive slot machine, featuring a convenient countdown timer so you always know exactly when your next spin is ready.\nPerformance Enhancements: We have applied various under-the-hood optimizations and general stability improvements to ensure your time at the tables is smoother and more reliable than ever.\nLooking Ahead: With this update complete, our team is now 100% laser-focused on finalizing our highly anticipated Multi-Table Tournaments (MTT). Get ready for the ultimate competitive experience!", "created_date": 1785750074, "id": "27735570329435602", "version": "6.6.8", "version_code": 309, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27735565399436095"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6795516673867606", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28178388931820404"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785330279, "id": "27679822848343684", "version": "6.6.8", "version_code": 308, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27679817065010929"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6795516673867606", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28178388931820404"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785304057, "id": "27676277742031528", "version": "6.6.8", "version_code": 307, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27676273098698659"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}